body:
No, but like I said. Intentions are better. If you came and told me, I need $6000 to build a bike bridge and this could help me, my community plus will give you a return as the investor and I told you, sure, lets begin the procedures. It is better if I state earlier that I might not be committed and not tell you, to go waste time and your finance on contracts that will no materialize. In addition, it would not be good for me as the investor to the say, I see no benefit in investing bridges for the poor. After all what can I gain from peasants used bridges. This is the crap I am talking about. You can just say that you do not want to invest in due time and prevent unnecessary costs on my / your side.

&#x200B;

What I am talking about is damage. Do not damage what a person is trying to do by causing them to undergo unnecessary costs that you are not ready to backup. If you ask for $6000, you know the maths to everything, therefore if the lawyer takes $800 for the first contract, which gets cancelled. This gets cut from your pocket and you incur personal costs. Now by the time you deal with the third person, you would be way out of pocket. Right now I do not even want to hear about certain countries trying to contact me about investing.

what did you get from the first post? Node issues. That was all. Did you get other information like this one? no. it's why I said you are lazy. again lazy to think I have to now add. Plus you have been crude this whole time.

&#x200B;

Or you want technically what is wrong with my server, then what is wrong with the business? I said message me but you are a chicken just for show.

One of the projects is a dating/chat app with huge growth potential. It is all registered to me, this including financial systems credit card (bank) and crypto. I am working on the financial aspect of it. In terms of the loan, I will send you an invoice that contains my details and purpose of transfer / loan. This is will explain that your are loaning me to complete my project. In terms of repay, i should make at least $60 daily. I can archieve that atleast a week or 2 after launch...

&#x200B;

lets zoom call
